    <bib:Memo rdf:about="#item_227">
        <rdf:value>&lt;div data-schema-version=&quot;9&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Comment: ACL 2020&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;u&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: #ffd40080&quot;&gt;My comments:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: #ffd40080&quot;&gt; I didn’t read the paper but they need known OOD data to implement their method which is not applicable in practice. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;</rdf:value>
