&lt;p&gt;Apparently, this study is encompassed in the study:&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(255, 119, 0)&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(255, 119, 0)&quot;&gt;A Survey on Hallucination in Large Language Models: Principles, Taxonomy, Challenges, and Open Questions 2025&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
